{{box title="Status of this page"}}
Status: In Progress.

This page answers §2.3 Open item O-18. It adds no new entity. It collects the typed edges already recorded on the §1.1 to §1.3 pages (each page's //Graph edges// lines), the Value Tensions that are still open with the stance currently taken on each, and the completeness check the Foundation phase allows.

It is built from the Foundation pages only. No primary data has been collected by this project: every Foundation entity rests on literature and group reasoning and is flagged provisional, so every edge below carries the same status. Edges that two pages recorded differently have been fixed on the source pages; //One-sided and inconsistent edges// lists what was changed.
{{/box}}

= Foundation Coherence =

//No new entity here. The edge inventory over everything documented in §1.1 to §1.3, plus the completeness check available at this stage.//

**Report Format:** §1.4 Foundation Coherence

= Edge inventory =

Edges are listed by source ID, with the relation named as it appears on the source page. Targets outside §1.1 to §1.3 (Functions F1 to F4, OBJ, DS, HP, RP, and the UC01 Premises and Claims) are forward edges into the Specification and are included so the inventory is complete.

