== Dangling references and orphans ==

**Dangling references** (an ID cited that is defined nowhere): none found. Every SA, ST, PS, HV, VT, HFC, M, EM and TECH ID cited on the Foundation pages is defined on its own page, and every forward reference resolves: F1 to F4, OBJ-01, UC01, UC02, UC01-F1-PR1 to UC01-F4-PR4 and UC01-F2-CL1 to UC01-F3-CL11 on the §2.3 page, DS-01 and DS-02 on the §2.1 page, and HP-01, HP-02 and RP-01 on the §2.2 Personas and Profiles page.

**Orphans** (an entity no Graph edges line connects to anything):

|=Entity|=Where it is mentioned|=Stance
|TECH-06 Medication tray or dispenser with sensors (deferred)|In prose only: VT-06's floor discussion and UC02's scope decision.|Deferred with UC02. Its edges (addresses Goal (SA-02), strains VT-06) are to be drawn when UC02 is specified.

TECH-05 was an orphan in the first draft; its Graph edges now record that it would ease VT-04 and VT-02 and is the fallback for TECH-01. No other entity is an orphan. ST-03, ST-04 and ST-05 are connected only through "holds" edges, consistent with their Indirect type.

