|M-08 operationalizes HV-05|b1: HV-05 listed only M-04|M-08 added
|HFC associated-measure → M-01, M-03, M-04|b4: no associated HFC on M-01, M-03, M-04|M-01 → HFC-06; M-03 → HFC-03; M-04 → HFC-03, HFC-04, HFC-05
|TECH-08 would strain VT-02|b2: VT-02 strained-by|TECH-08 (rejected) added
|UC01-F2-CL10 grounds on HFC-03, uses M-04 and M-06|b3 HFC-03 grounds; b4 M-04, M-06|CL10 added to all three
|UC01-F3-CL11 uses M-02|b4: M-02|CL11 added
|VT-07 tested-by CL9 and CL11|b2: VT-07 Status named CL9 only|CL11 named in the Status field
